<b>You have</b> rice for lunch.

00:00:23.865 --> 00:00:26.384
<b>You don’t have</b> pasta for lunch.

00:00:32.356 --> 00:00:34.677
<b>We have</b> coffee for breakfast.

00:00:39.637 --> 00:00:42.381
<b>We don’t have</b> tea for breakfast.

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:50.365
<b>They have</b> fish for dinner.

00:00:55.389 --> 00:00:57.906
<b>They don’t have</b> meat for dinner.